==Strategy==
This stage is filled with peons so it's advised to bring some wave units like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] to quickly dispatch of them and make way for your attackers to kill the bosses. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] stands at a safe enough distance to deal high damage to the bosses. Don't forget to constantly meatshield so Balrog doesn't hit any of your important units.

